1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,104
Welcome everyone.

2
00:00:01,454 --> 00:00:06,806
Today I'm joined by Eve from Club Madeira to talk about their Smart Catalogue.

3
00:00:07,156 --> 00:00:09,244
Eve, thank you for joining us.

4
00:00:10,194 --> 00:00:12,570
Thank you Leo, it's great to be here.

5
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,224
Let's start with the basics.

6
00:00:15,574 --> 00:00:18,622
What exactly is the Smart Catalogue?

7
00:00:19,572 --> 00:00:26,796
The Smart Catalogue by Club Madeira is a B2B, invite-only, white-label AI-powered fundraising engine.

8
00:00:27,146 --> 00:00:37,322
It's designed specifically for professional partners — website designers, digital agencies, consultants, and service providers — who work with clubs and community groups.

9
00:00:37,672 --> 00:00:43,048
These partners can embed a fully white-labelled Smart Catalogue into their clients’ websites.

10
00:00:43,398 --> 00:00:50,166
The AI automatically creates and manages a smart online shop with products that members are likely to love.

11
00:00:50,516 --> 00:00:59,756
When members shop, the club earns commission, the partner gets recurring revenue, and merchants get targeted exposure — all with almost no extra work.

12
00:01:00,706 --> 00:01:03,106
Who is this platform actually for?

13
00:01:04,056 --> 00:01:07,392
It's exclusively for approved professional partners.

14
00:01:07,742 --> 00:01:09,686
Clubs don't buy it directly.

15
00:01:10,036 --> 00:01:14,476
Partners control the client relationship, branding, pricing, and support.

16
00:01:14,826 --> 00:01:22,434
There are no monthly platform fees, no stock to manage, and everything can be handled from a dashboard or even a smartphone app.

17
00:01:23,384 --> 00:01:27,200
How does the AI actually choose which products to show?

18
00:01:28,150 --> 00:01:32,158
The AI uses a practical, interest-based curation system.

19
00:01:32,508 --> 00:01:42,612
Club admins pick their group's main interests and categories through the smartphone app — things like model flying, scouting, sports, crafts, parenting, etc.

20
00:01:42,962 --> 00:01:51,098
The AI then pulls products from trusted merchant feeds and APIs, matches them to those interests, and scores them for relevance.

21
00:01:51,448 --> 00:01:57,520
The catalogue is living — it updates daily, adding new products and removing ones that are no longer relevant.

22
00:01:58,470 --> 00:02:02,790
During some conversations, your team mentioned keeping products in a 'Vault'.

23
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:04,700
What is that exactly?

24
00:02:05,650 --> 00:02:09,514
The Vault is our internal name for the central product database.

25
00:02:09,864 --> 00:02:13,824
We don't hold any physical stock — this is a pure affiliate model.

26
00:02:14,174 --> 00:02:19,838
Merchants connect their stores via APIs, and we pull product data into our system.

27
00:02:20,188 --> 00:02:29,188
It's essentially a large, well-organized database of normalised product information that our AI can search and curate from efficiently.

28
00:02:30,138 --> 00:02:34,074
Your salesman described this Vault as very rare and special.

29
00:02:34,424 --> 00:02:36,920
Is a database really that unusual?

30
00:02:37,870 --> 00:02:42,862
Databases themselves are very common — almost every modern website uses one.

31
00:02:43,212 --> 00:02:56,772
What makes our system special is not the database, but how we combine it with powerful AI to automatically build and maintain highly relevant catalogues for thousands of different communities with almost no manual effort.

32
00:02:57,122 --> 00:03:03,434
That level of smart automation, especially in the club and community fundraising space, is quite rare.

33
00:03:04,384 --> 00:03:07,576
So would you say the salesman was overselling it a bit?

34
00:03:08,526 --> 00:03:10,998
There's always a bit of sales enthusiasm!

35
00:03:11,348 --> 00:03:17,540
The core technology — a database plus AI curation — isn't unique in the broader e-commerce world.

36
00:03:17,890 --> 00:03:32,794
But the specific combination we’ve built: white-label for agencies, smartphone-first admin, fully automated curation, zero stock, and strong focus on community fundraising, is genuinely valuable and unusual in this niche.

37
00:03:33,144 --> 00:03:36,384
We prefer to focus on the real benefits rather than hype.

38
00:03:37,334 --> 00:03:38,270
Thank you Eve.

39
00:03:38,620 --> 00:03:40,516
This has been very insightful.

40
00:03:40,866 --> 00:03:44,082
I'm excited to see how the Smart Catalogue develops.

41
00:03:45,032 --> 00:03:46,040
Thank you Leo.

42
00:03:46,390 --> 00:03:47,470
It was a pleasure.

